# Git commits — no Co-authored-by

- **Never** add `Co-authored-by:` (or similar trailer) to commit messages.
- Do not attribute Cursor, the agent, or any tool as a co-author.
- Commit messages are only the subject/body the user would write; no automated trailers unless the user explicitly requests one.
